# NOTICE

This repository is **companion source code** for the NICE TEAS Europe 2026 paper:

> Adaptive LLM-Generated Questionnaires for Suicide Risk Assessment: A Clinical Pilot in Greece

## What is licensed

- Python pipeline code under `main.py`, `src/adaptive_questionnaires/`, `scripts/run.sh`, and related docs are released under the **MIT License** (see `LICENSE`).

## What is not included / not licensed for redistribution

- Clinical Google Sheets content, patient histories, session notes, and Likert responses
- Local `data/` and `visualizations/` exports (gitignored)
- OAuth secrets and `config/config.ini`
- Any personally identifiable information (PII)

## Clinical / ethics constraints

- Ethics protocol: **KL-2025-07/ETH** (Scientific Committee of KLIMAKA, July 2025)
- LLM outputs are for **clinician-supervised** questionnaire generation only — not diagnosis or automated risk scoring
- Crisis (Greece): **1018** (KLIMAKA)

See the "Ethics & safety" section of `README.md`.

